WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
Check your guests' allergies before
offering cake,

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.600
and mention the wheat,

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.380
eggs, milk, and frosting ingredients.

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:10.580
Cut small wedges with a clean knife,

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.080
then lift each slice onto a plate.

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:18.580
Cover any leftovers, and follow the
frosting label's storage instructions.
